                                                "sense_id": "8c43920f-e0f6-3af9-9dff-dbb4f009694e",
                                                "text": "The Sediment (SNAP-7E) Density Meter (an underwater rocket) has been developed to investigate to an ocean-bottom depth of 11 sedimentary feet. Sea Lab I, the Navy’s new undersea laboratory, complete with observation porch and garage, should become safe to operate at the 200 foot level."
                                            },
